# DTO Rules

- Every property: **class-validator** decorators + **`@ApiProperty()`** — no exceptions
- Optional fields: `@ApiPropertyOptional()` + `@IsOptional()`
- Nested objects/arrays: `@Type()` from class-transformer
- Response DTOs: never include `passwordHash`, raw tokens, or other sensitive fields

```typescript
import { ApiProperty, ApiPropertyOptional } from '@nestjs/swagger';
import { IsString, IsNotEmpty, IsOptional } from 'class-validator';

export class CreateProductDto {
  @ApiProperty({ example: 'Italian Marble 600x600' })
  @IsString()
  @IsNotEmpty()
  name: string;

  @ApiPropertyOptional({ example: 'Premium quality marble tiles' })
  @IsOptional()
  @IsString()
  description?: string;
}
```
